  "authorNotes": "Class 5 Bangla, built from the published Sylhet syllabus (whole book except lesson 12 'শিষ্যের সাধনা' — nothing is taken from lesson 12). The textbook is the national 'আমার বাংলা বই' 2026 (23 lessons), the same book the Mohammadpur 2026 final uses. Reused from MP Annual 2026: word meanings (5 of its 11 words), the 'complete the next sentence' exercise (Q4, used for row 3 বাক্য গঠন), the adjective fill-in (Q6, with the book's bracket hints added), synonyms (Q5, verbatim), 4 of its 5 short questions, 3 of its 5 long questions (all three are in the book: সংকল্প, ইচ্ছামতী, বিদায় হজ), the one-word items (Q3, verbatim), the transfer-certificate application (Q9, without the 'অথবা' letter) and the essay topic (Q10, with সংকেত added because the row says সূত্রসহ). MP's passage (Q1, Egypt) is reused for row 11 as a question-making passage; I corrected one factual slip in it — MP's text says Giza has a world-famous 'মসজিদ', which should be the pyramids. From other MP papers: চলিত রূপ (HY 2025 Q6) and যুক্তবর্ণ (Final 2025 Q3). New from the book: row 1 poem (সাইক্লোন — clued by its subject so the poem/poet names are actually tested; if the owner prefers 'any poem from the book', change the instruction), the 5 MCQs and the মূলভাব stanza (রাখাল ছেলে). MP items not used: Q8(ক) 'মুসলিম হিসেবে আপনি কী হতে চান' and Q8(গ) (not textbook-based), Q7(ঘ). Doubts: (1) For row 3 I read 'বাক্য গঠন' as MP's sentence-completion; if the owner means 'make a sentence with the word', swap in words like নিদর্শন, সমবেত, মন্থর. (2) Row 6/10/11/14/15 are either/or rows; I chose সমার্থক শব্দ, ভাষারীতি (চলিত রূপ), প্রশ্ন তৈরি, আবেদনপত্র and a সূত্রসহ রচনা. (3) MP's synonym row asks 2 synonyms per word for 1 mark; kept as MP wrote it."
